able community, your sanctuary in the wilderness.</strong> These colossal machines are the heart of your operations, allowing you to push deeper into The March with each journey. Strategic planning is key as you outfit your Landship, manage its resources, and navigate the challenges of space and logistics. Every decision matters as you chart a course through the unknown, forging a path towards the heart of The March. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/b6356fa5144178b1d4c910ec7377e4f8.avif?t=1755200442\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/76cdfc4688f40bf46eb5fd839baf85f3.poster.avif?t=1755200442\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/76cdfc4688f40bf46eb5fd839baf85f3.webm?t=1755200442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/76cdfc4688f40bf46eb5fd839baf85f3.mp4?t=1755200442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in tactical landship-to-landship combat amidst the boundless expanse of The March.</strong> Real-time action blends with tactical pause, making every skirmish a test of wit and skill. Command your crew and adapt to the shifting battlefield: the morale of your characters will directly impact their performance, adding another layer of strategic depth to each encounter. Victory or defeat \u2013 every battle is a testament to your resilience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/d7615ce224e1d6b48ba6a452e4d6db95.avif?t=1755200442\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/986e0fdbbc7145ae75184e8b1114de1c.poster.avif?t=1755200442\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/986e0fdbbc7145ae75184e8b1114de1c.webm?t=1755200442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671300/extras/986e0fdbbc7145ae75184e8b1114de1c.mp4?t=1755200442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The journey is just as important as the destination.</strong> Explore the vast and mysterious expanse of The March, encountering enigmatic wonders and unpredictable events along the way. Death is not the end: with each expedition you will keep your progress on the ever-changing grounds of The March, pushing further into the unknown with each daring foray. Embrace the thrill of discovery, uncover the secrets that lie hidden in the depths, and leave your mark as a true Trailblazer.</p>",
